[2026-08-03 17:45:22] Mirror: Fixed pass role ordering bug -- git_config (scope=local) was running before git init, moved git init task before git_config.
[2026-08-03 17:49:53] Mirror: Fixed restic role -- replaced hardcoded restic_user=nacho with ansible_user, removed restic_user from defaults, gated client-side tasks on restic_backup_paths to skip rammstein (SFTP target only, no local backups).
[2026-08-03 17:59:47] Mirror: Fixed pass role git init -- all git tasks were gated on `not pass_store.stat.exists` (checking .gpg-id), but .gpg-id already existed from a previous run so git init was skipped. Added independent `pass_git` stat check on ~/.password-store/.git so git tasks run independently of pass init state.
[2026-08-03 18:09:53] Mirror: Fixed restic role -- sophon was not set up as SFTP target. Only rammstein had restic user + authorized_keys. Yoga's primary backup target is sftp:restic@10.66.0.5 (sophon), but sophon had no restic user with nologin shell, no .ssh/authorized_keys, and the /srv/restic dir was owned by nacho not restic. Merged rammstein + sophon SFTP target setup into shared tasks gated on inventory_hostname in ['rammstein', 'sophon'].
[2026-08-03 18:12:54] Mirror: Fixed SFTP for restic user -- nologin shell prints a message before SFTP starts, corrupting the protocol ("packet too long"). Added Match User restic block to sshd_config with ForceCommand internal-sftp to bypass the shell entirely.
[2026-08-03 18:25:18] Mirror: Fixed SELinux denials for restic SFTP -- three issues: (1) authorized_keys had var_t context, sshd_session_t couldn't read it. Fix: sefcontext to ssh_home_t on /srv/restic/.ssh. (2) internal-sftp dyntransition to sftpd_t was denied. Fix: custom SELinux module allowing dyntransition + pipe read + unix_dgram_socket create. (3) Repo files owned by nacho from previous run. Fix: recursive chown to restic. Also added checkpolicy + policycoreutils-python-utils to package install list.
[2026-08-03 18:34:22] Mirror: Moved restic and git-repo from /srv to /home to avoid SELinux issues. Restic: /srv/restic -> /home/restic/backups, removed SELinux module tasks entirely. Git: /srv/git -> /home/git/repos. Updated host_vars for yoga, sophon, rammstein. Kept Match User restic block in sshd_config for internal-sftp.
[2026-08-03 18:42:07] Mirror: Eliminated SELinux sftpd_t denials by removing ForceCommand internal-sftp entirely. Instead, set restic user's shell directly to /usr/libexec/openssh/sftp-server. This avoids the dyntransition from sshd_session_t to sftpd_t that was causing pipe read/write and socket create denials. Removed Match User restic block from sshd_config. Added sftp-server to /etc/shells so it's accepted as a valid login shell.